# Claude Code agent scratch space
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.json
# .claude/skills/ is TRACKED — these are the repo's own runbooks (ship, local-qa,
# sr-design, project-page, workflow-node) and losing them to a disk rebuild has
# cost real time. They carry NO host addresses, users, key paths or secrets:
# this repo is public, so the VPS is reached through the `sr-vps` alias in
# ~/.ssh/config (see the local-qa skill). Keep it that way.

